# Onibex ASK — License Structure

This repository contains two complementary bodies of work under different licenses.
Each directory carries its own full license text; this file is the authoritative map.

| Path | License | Full text |
|---|---|---|
| `definition/**` | GNU Affero General Public License v3.0 (AGPL-3.0) | [`definition/LICENSE`](definition/LICENSE) |
| `platform/**` | PolyForm Strict License 1.0.0 | [`platform/LICENSE.md`](platform/LICENSE.md) |
| Root files (`README.md`, this file) | CC BY 4.0 | <https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/> |

In short:

- **`definition/`** — the open ASK specification. Free to adopt, extend, and implement
  under AGPL-3.0.
- **`platform/`** — the Onibex ASK Platform. Source-available for noncommercial use,
  research, evaluation, and personal study under PolyForm Strict 1.0.0. Any commercial
  or production use requires a commercial license from Onibex, Inc. — contact
  <https://onibex.com>.

